{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_025","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"{\n\"id\" : 5 ,\n\"status\" : \"success\" ,\n\"type\" : \"response\" ,\n\"result\" : {\n\"account_data\" : {\n\"Account\" : \"rG1QQv2nh2gr7RCZ1P8YYcBUKCCN633jCn\" ,\n\"Balance\" : \"999999999960\" ,\n\"Flags\" : 8388608 ,\n\"LedgerEntryType\" : \"AccountRoot\" ,\n\"OwnerCount\" : 0 ,\n\"PreviousTxnID\" : \"4294BEBE5B569A18C0A2702387C9B1E7146DC3A5850C1E87204951C6FDAA4C42\" ,\n\"PreviousTxnLgrSeq\" : 3 ,\n\"Sequence\" : 6 ,\n\"index\" : \"92FA6A9FC8EA6018D5D16532D7795C91BFB0831355BDFDA177E86C8BF997985F\"\n},\n\"ledger_current_index\" : 4 ,\n\"queue_data\" : {\n\"auth_change_queued\" : true ,\n\"highest_sequence\" : 10 ,\n\"lowest_sequence\" : 6 ,\n\"max_spend_drops_total\" : \"500\" ,\n\"transactions\" : [\n{\n\"auth_change\" : false ,\n\"fee\" : \"100\" ,\n\"fee_level\" : \"2560\" ,\n\"max_spend_drops\" : \"100\" ,\n\"seq\" : 6\n},\n...","location_hint":"paragraph 129","char_start":3705,"char_end":4448,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_026","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"(trimmed for length) ...\n{\n\"LastLedgerSequence\" : 10 ,\n\"auth_change\" : true ,\n\"fee\" : \"100\" ,\n\"fee_level\" : \"2560\" ,\n\"max_spend_drops\" : \"100\" ,\n\"seq\" : 10\n}\n],\n\"txn_count\" : 5\n},\n\"validated\" : false\n}\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 129","char_start":4449,"char_end":4652,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_027","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"The response follows the standard format , with the result containing the requested account, its data, and a ledger to which it applies, as the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 130","char_start":4654,"char_end":4815,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_028","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"account_data Object The AccountRoot ledger object with this account&#x27;s information, as stored in the ledger.","location_hint":"paragraph 132","char_start":4845,"char_end":4957,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_029","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"account_flags Object The account&#x27;s flag statuses (see below), based on the Flags field of the account.","location_hint":"paragraph 133","char_start":4959,"char_end":5066,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_030","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"signer_lists Array API v1 : (Omitted unless the request specified signer_lists and at least one SignerList is associated with the account.) Array of SignerList ledger objects associated with this account for Multi-Signing . Since an account can own at most one SignerList, this array must have exactly one member if it is present. The field is nested under account_data .\nAPI v2 : Identical to API v1, but the field is returned in the root response instead. Clio implements the API v2 behavior in all cases.","location_hint":"paragraph 134","char_start":5068,"char_end":5575,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_031","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"ledger_current_index Integer (Omitted if ledger_index is provided instead) The ledger index of the current in-progress ledger, which was used when retrieving this information.","location_hint":"paragraph 135","char_start":5577,"char_end":5752,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_032","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"ledger_index Integer (Omitted if ledger_current_index is provided instead) The ledger index of the ledger version used when retrieving this information. The information does not contain any changes from ledger versions newer than this one.","location_hint":"paragraph 136","char_start":5754,"char_end":5993,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_033","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"queue_data Object (Omitted unless queue specified as true and querying the current open ledger.) Information about queued transactions sent by this account. This information describes the state of the local rippled server, which may be different from other servers in the peer-to-peer XRP Ledger network . Some fields may be omitted because the values are calculated \"lazily\" by the queuing mechanism.","location_hint":"paragraph 137","char_start":5995,"char_end":6396,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_034","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"validated Boolean True if this data is from a validated ledger version; if omitted or set to false, this data is not final.","location_hint":"paragraph 138","char_start":6398,"char_end":6521,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_035","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"The account_flags field contains the following nested fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 139","char_start":6525,"char_end":6586,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_036","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"defaultRipple Boolean If true , the account allows rippling on its trust lines by default.","location_hint":"paragraph 141","char_start":6616,"char_end":6706,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_037","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"depositAuth Boolean If true , the account is using Deposit Authorization and does not accept any payments from unknown parties.","location_hint":"paragraph 142","char_start":6708,"char_end":6835,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_038","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"disableMasterKey Boolean If true , the account&#x27;s master key pair is disabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 143","char_start":6837,"char_end":6919,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_039","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"disallowIncomingCheck Boolean If true , the account does not allow others to send Checks to it.","location_hint":"paragraph 144","char_start":6921,"char_end":7016,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_040","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"Requires the DisallowIncoming amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 145","char_start":7018,"char_end":7070,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_041","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"disallowIncomingNFTokenOffer Boolean If true , the account does not allow others to make NFT buy or sell offers to it.","location_hint":"paragraph 146","char_start":7074,"char_end":7192,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_042","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"Requires the DisallowIncoming amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 147","char_start":7194,"char_end":7246,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_043","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"disallowIncomingPayChan Boolean If true , the account does not allow others to make Payment Channels to it.","location_hint":"paragraph 148","char_start":7250,"char_end":7357,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_044","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"Requires the DisallowIncoming amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 149","char_start":7359,"char_end":7411,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_045","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"disallowIncomingTrustline Boolean If true , the account does not allow others to make trust lines to it.","location_hint":"paragraph 150","char_start":7415,"char_end":7519,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_046","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"Requires the DisallowIncoming amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 151","char_start":7521,"char_end":7573,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_047","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"disallowIncomingXRP Boolean If true , the account does not want to receive XRP from others. (This is advisory, and not enforced at a protocol level.)","location_hint":"paragraph 152","char_start":7577,"char_end":7726,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_048","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"globalFreeze Boolean If true , all tokens issued by the account are currently frozen.","location_hint":"paragraph 153","char_start":7728,"char_end":7813,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_049","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"noFreeze Boolean If true , the account has permanently given up the abilities to freeze individual trust lines or end a global freeze. See No Freeze for details.","location_hint":"paragraph 154","char_start":7815,"char_end":7976,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_050","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"passwordSpent Boolean If false , the account can send a special key reset transaction with a transaction cost of 0. The protocol turns this flag on and off automatically; it is not controlled by a user-facing setting.","location_hint":"paragraph 155","char_start":7978,"char_end":8195,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_051","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"requireAuthorization Boolean If true , the account is using Authorized Trust Lines to limit who can hold the tokens it issues.","location_hint":"paragraph 156","char_start":8197,"char_end":8323,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_052","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"requireDestinationTag Boolean If true , the account requires a destination tag on all payments it receives.","location_hint":"paragraph 157","char_start":8325,"char_end":8432,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_053","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"The queue_data field, if present, contains the following nested fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 158","char_start":8436,"char_end":8507,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_054","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"txn_count Integer Number of queued transactions from this address.","location_hint":"paragraph 160","char_start":8537,"char_end":8603,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_055","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"auth_change_queued Boolean (May be omitted) Whether a transaction in the queue changes this address&#x27;s ways of authorizing transactions . If true , this address can queue no further transactions until that transaction has been executed or dropped from the queue.","location_hint":"paragraph 161","char_start":8605,"char_end":8871,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_056","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"lowest_sequence Integer (May be omitted) The lowest Sequence Number among transactions queued by this address.","location_hint":"paragraph 162","char_start":8873,"char_end":8983,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_057","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"highest_sequence Integer (May be omitted) The highest Sequence Number among transactions queued by this address.","location_hint":"paragraph 163","char_start":8985,"char_end":9097,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_ec68826269c9_058","source_id":"src_ec68826269c9","source_hash":"83e67b24d742b7042fd68bf0d926788f50ef89a0157a2b7ceec3ea29362d0b16","text":"max_spend_drops_total String (May be omitted) Integer amount of drops of XRP that could be debited from this address if every transaction in the queue consumes the maximum amount of XRP possible.","location_hint":"paragraph 164","char_start":9099,"char_end":9294,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:22:51.131Z"}
